# Every study's data cache, by rule rather than by enumeration — a new
# study's cache/ is ignored the day it exists. Regenerability varies BY
# STUDY and deletion is not free:
#   pead-llm-gate/cache is IRREPLACEABLE — texts/ is 2,844 EDGAR filings
#   (~$100 of fetches) and llm_contam/ is $118.09 of inference from models
#   that have since been retired. Never delete it to reclaim space.
#   chart-llm-gate/cache regenerates in ~2 min of API time for bars, but
#   the verdicts cost ~4.3h of 3090 wall-clock per full local-model pass.
#   The 2026-08-10 alpha-scan caches (astro-null, intraday-mft, 0dte-vrp,
#   factor-lab, macro-drift, open-window, …) are one fetch each.
research/*/cache/
research/astro-null/_vendor/
research/pead-llm-gate/scripts/archive/_ict_cache/

# Study stage exports: the trade table the paper's appendix is built from,
# the equity curves, and batch progress. Regenerable from the cache by
# re-running the stages -- run state, not source.
research/pead-llm-gate/payload/
